28
00:03:22.535 --> 00:03:23.494 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>&lrm;（诚）</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:23.578 --> 00:03:27.290 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
