47
00:04:41.489 --> 00:04:43.074 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然站在不同的立场上</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:43.157 --> 00:04:47.829 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但都是用自己的剑
赌上性命和信念来战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:49.872 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>或许</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:49.956 --> 00:04:56.045 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起现在政府中身居要职的维新志士
