51
00:04:59.257 --> 00:05:01.426 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然听起来很奇怪吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:05:01.509 --> 00:05:03.928 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 不是</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:05:04.012 --> 00:05:09.267 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是剑心会谈到这么多过去的事情
