54
00:05:11.311 --> 00:05:12.854 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 我们快走吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:05:15.106 --> 00:05:19.610 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的很久没有梦见那时候的事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:05:20.611 --> 00:05:23.281 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你傻站着干嘛？剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:05:23.364 --> 00:05:24.782 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们快走吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:05:25.867 --> 00:05:28.745 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明明最近完全没有梦到了</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:29.412 --> 00:05:31.039 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么刚刚…</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:36.127 --> 00:05:40.548 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死 特地过来蹭饭吃的</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:40.631 --> 00:05:42.842 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这帮家伙到底去哪了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:42.925 --> 00:05:44.135 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你好</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:45.636 --> 00:05:46.846 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你谁啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:49.766 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>初次见面</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:49.849 --> 00:05:55.438 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是多摩来的药商
专卖一种叫做石田散药的灵药</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:56.397 --> 00:05:58.566 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我叫藤田五郎</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:59.901 --> 00:06:00.777 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:04.906 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>石田散药
对跌打损伤、骨折都很有用…</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:06:04.989 --> 00:06:08.117 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下 我不住这</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:06:08.201 --> 00:06:12.330 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>主人不在啊 那真是太可惜了</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:06:12.413 --> 00:06:14.332 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-喂 你
-什么事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:06:14.415 --> 00:06:17.877 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说你的眼睛真是又窄又长啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:06:19.587 --> 00:06:21.422 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是天生的</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:06:21.506 --> 00:06:23.299 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:06:24.217 --> 00:06:25.134 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那…</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:06:26.886 --> 00:06:33.226 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个药商居然会有用刀的人才有的茧
这总不是天生的吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:33.309 --> 00:06:35.853 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你到底是什么人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:38.648 --> 00:06:40.817 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还真是敏锐啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:41.442 --> 00:06:42.944 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>相乐左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:46.489 --> 00:06:49.492 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊 拔刀斋不在家啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:53.246 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这家伙怎么知道剑心的过去…</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:54.831 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:57.125 --> 00:06:59.418 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就给他留点礼物吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:07:00.795 --> 00:07:02.964 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还藏了这种东西…</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:07:03.756 --> 00:07:06.926 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你一开始就是过来找茬的吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:07:07.718 --> 00:07:08.719 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:07:08.803 --> 00:07:10.555 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就来会会你</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:07:10.638 --> 00:07:13.724 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>用我的拳头问出你真正的身份！</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:07:18.521 --> 00:07:19.939 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:07:20.523 --> 00:07:25.027 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>传说你是第一打手 你的拳的确不错</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:07:25.111 --> 00:07:26.487 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没用吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:07:27.238 --> 00:07:31.826 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过只能适用于明治这个平安年代</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:07:31.909 --> 00:07:35.246 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>若是在幕末时期的京都 这种拳头</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:36.038 --> 00:07:37.582 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>根本没用</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:42.628 --> 00:07:45.423 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你怎么走的这么慢 剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:45.506 --> 00:07:48.009 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>再磨磨蹭蹭的 天就黑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:48.593 --> 00:07:50.553 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>感觉你没什么精神</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:50.636 --> 00:07:52.513 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是不是胃不舒服啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:52.597 --> 00:07:56.058 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦 那就轮到我出场了</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:56.142 --> 00:07:58.936 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐！你怎么在这？</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:00.897 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这么吃惊干嘛？</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:03.232 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这里是大街</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:08:03.316 --> 00:08:05.318 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我难道不能在这走吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:08:05.401 --> 00:08:07.195 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>开玩笑的</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:08:07.278 --> 00:08:12.700 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实我今天和明天休息
所以就过来玩了</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:08:12.783 --> 00:08:15.703 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝对不行！狐狸女禁止入内！</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:08:15.786 --> 00:08:20.291 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 某人受伤的时候是谁治的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:08:20.374 --> 00:08:22.001 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且还免费？</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:08:22.793 --> 00:08:25.505 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦 你怎么想？</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:25.588 --> 00:08:27.423 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>晚饭就由我来做</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:27.507 --> 00:08:30.676 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有什么关系啊 薰？别这么小气啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:32.136 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你个叛徒！</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:35.556 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 阿剑 我过来玩可以吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:38.809 --> 00:08:41.646 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>感觉你真的没什么精神</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:41.729 --> 00:08:43.606 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不我给你看看吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:43.689 --> 00:08:47.568 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用 没关系 没什么的</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:50.029 --> 00:08:52.073 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不能再发愁了</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:52.156 --> 00:08:54.450 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只会让身边的人担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:55.576 --> 00:08:58.371 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算突然梦到了过去的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:58.454 --> 00:09:00.748 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也没必要想太多</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:09:01.332 --> 00:09:02.917 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也想不出个结果</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:09:05.419 --> 00:09:08.381 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这…怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:09:12.218 --> 00:09:13.594 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>血腥味！</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:09:16.722 --> 00:09:17.932 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左！</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:09:29.318 --> 00:09:32.738 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来 先喝一杯 藤田</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:33.447 --> 00:09:35.199 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>或者在这里</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:35.283 --> 00:09:38.536 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>叫你斋藤比较好吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:38.619 --> 00:09:40.580 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>您想叫什么都可以</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:40.663 --> 00:09:43.666 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有酒就不必了</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:43.749 --> 00:09:47.920 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真没想到你不喝酒啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:48.004 --> 00:09:50.631 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 不是</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:51.424 --> 00:09:56.095 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是我一喝了酒 就非常想胡乱杀人</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:59.890 --> 00:10:02.768 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你还真是可靠啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:10:04.061 --> 00:10:06.856 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我们进入正题吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:10:06.939 --> 00:10:12.528 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-绯村拔刀斋现在…
-在一个叫做神谷道场的地方</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:10:12.612 --> 00:10:13.988 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我白天去过了</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:10:15.323 --> 00:10:17.199 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不在</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:10:17.283 --> 00:10:21.037 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不愧是前新选组第三小队队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:26.417 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说你要加入我们时
说实话我吃了一惊</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:30.880 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过果然可以放心把工作交给你啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:31.464 --> 00:10:33.841 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也是吃了一惊</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:34.467 --> 00:10:36.636 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到黑笠事件的幕后黑手</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:36.719 --> 00:10:42.600 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>鹈堂刃卫的指使人
竟然是元老院书记涩海先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:43.434 --> 00:10:48.022 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治政府内部也很复杂的</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:48.105 --> 00:10:49.398 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>的确如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:10:50.066 --> 00:10:54.028 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过这与在维新中落败的我没有关系</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:10:54.695 --> 00:10:59.659 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能把这意外捡来的半条命过得有趣</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:59.742 --> 00:11:00.993 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就已经足够了</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:11:01.577 --> 00:11:04.205 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀人是我的特长</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:11:04.288 --> 00:11:08.626 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以这是我求之不得的副业</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:11:08.709 --> 00:11:14.632 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>更何况第一个工作
就是抹杀过去的宿敌</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:11:18.636 --> 00:11:21.472 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过我有一点不解</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:11:22.223 --> 00:11:24.600 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么要特意暗杀一个</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:11:24.683 --> 00:11:26.811 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经下野的浪客？</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:11:27.561 --> 00:11:31.273 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这件事的委托人究竟是谁？</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:11:31.357 --> 00:11:33.776 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-喂！
-失礼了</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:11:33.859 --> 00:11:36.278 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是我多嘴了</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:11:36.362 --> 00:11:38.948 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事 你知道就好</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:11:39.031 --> 00:11:41.951 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 现在不要再提工作的事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:11:42.034 --> 00:11:44.578 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>尽情享受吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:11:44.662 --> 00:11:48.124 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用了 我差不多该回归本职工作了</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:11:48.207 --> 00:11:49.917 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>否则别人要起疑心了</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:11:54.338 --> 00:11:57.716 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那本官就告辞了</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:12:03.264 --> 00:12:07.935 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>前新选组第三小队队长 斋藤一</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:12:08.018 --> 00:12:10.938 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>维新后改名为藤田五郎</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:12:11.021 --> 00:12:14.275 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在西南战争中
作为警视厅拔刀队的一员参战</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:12:14.358 --> 00:12:16.652 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在担任警部补一职</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:12:16.735 --> 00:12:20.489 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也有人说 他是比号称新选组最强的</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:12:20.573 --> 00:12:23.993 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>冲田总司更强的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:12:24.702 --> 00:12:30.958 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫也打不倒的拔刀斋
如果是他的话…</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:12:31.041 --> 00:12:32.835 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不喜欢他</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:12:32.918 --> 00:12:35.087 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一副奇怪的笑眯眯的样子</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:12:35.171 --> 00:12:38.549 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别那么多偏见 赤末</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:12:38.632 --> 00:12:40.593 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们要好好相处</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:12:41.635 --> 00:12:44.346 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>抹杀拔刀斋这件事顺利的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:48.642 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们就要彻底摆脱
暗杀重要人物这种脏活了</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:12:49.226 --> 00:12:50.811 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有趣的是</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:12:50.895 --> 00:12:54.899 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>促成这件事的人竟然来自于幕末时期</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:12:54.982 --> 00:12:57.109 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>严重威胁着我们的新选组</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:01.822 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>被称为壬生狼
令人闻风丧胆的新选组</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:13:01.906 --> 00:13:05.576 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在明治不过是没牙的丧家犬罢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:12.875 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>太暗了 我看不清伤口</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:13:12.958 --> 00:13:15.044 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>蜡烛什么的都行 再照亮一点！</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:13:15.127 --> 00:13:16.253 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:13:30.684 --> 00:13:31.936 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道…</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:13:34.772 --> 00:13:37.191 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（三天后）</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:13:41.779 --> 00:13:42.988 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:13:44.031 --> 00:13:45.616 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>浴室我用完了</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:13:45.699 --> 00:13:49.787 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我来照看左之助
你去泡个澡放松一下吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:51.580 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:13:52.373 --> 00:13:55.668 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-他情况怎么样？
-跟之前一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:13:56.293 --> 00:13:59.088 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-阿剑还在道场？
-没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:13:59.672 --> 00:14:01.465 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还在那里</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:14:01.549 --> 00:14:04.218 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>表情很可怕地沉思着什么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:14:06.262 --> 00:14:11.100 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然不论怎么想都是那家伙做的</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:14:11.684 --> 00:14:14.270 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>伞下画着一个圆形标志的药箱</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:14:14.353 --> 00:14:18.357 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是新选组的密探变装常用的道具</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:14:19.024 --> 00:14:21.443 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>水平刺出的刀刃</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:14:21.527 --> 00:14:25.364 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是新选组的特技平刺突的特征</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:14:26.198 --> 00:14:28.075 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且如此强的破坏力</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:14:28.158 --> 00:14:30.077 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在所有队员中</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:35.165 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只有他最擅长的左手平刺突能做到</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:14:36.917 --> 00:14:37.835 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:14:43.924 --> 00:14:44.925 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>牙突</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:14:53.893 --> 00:14:58.314 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组第三小队队长斋藤一</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:14:58.397 --> 00:15:01.400 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他来了结我们没分出胜负的决斗吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:15:01.483 --> 00:15:04.820 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还是有什么其他的目的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:15:07.156 --> 00:15:11.368 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论如何 他的剑术完全没有退步</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:15:24.173 --> 00:15:25.799 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>用着逆刃刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:15:26.383 --> 00:15:28.302 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>遵守着不杀的誓言</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:15:28.385 --> 00:15:31.263 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能成功击退他吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:39.939 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>久等了</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:15:40.022 --> 00:15:43.400 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-请慢用吧
-多谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:15:43.984 --> 00:15:46.737 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我开动了</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:15:49.615 --> 00:15:52.493 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只吃一碗清汤荞麦面？</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:15:52.576 --> 00:15:56.580 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是随意的午餐啊 是吧 斋藤？</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:15:57.414 --> 00:16:00.000 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很喜欢清汤荞麦面</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:16:00.084 --> 00:16:02.461 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且我现在叫藤田</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:16:03.045 --> 00:16:05.381 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你叫赤末 对吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:16:05.464 --> 00:16:07.174 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>找我有什么事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:16:07.841 --> 00:16:11.428 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没什么事 只是看你不爽</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:16:12.972 --> 00:16:18.143 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>本来这次的活应该归我</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:16:18.227 --> 00:16:22.731 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是涩海听说了你
就把活派给了你这个新来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:16:22.815 --> 00:16:25.818 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听着 如果你想做就动作快点</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:16:25.901 --> 00:16:28.445 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赶紧被杀了才好</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:16:30.948 --> 00:16:32.449 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有什么好笑的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:34.326 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:36.578 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:16:36.662 --> 00:16:41.417 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那这次我们一起行动如何？</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:42.376 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:16:42.459 --> 00:16:47.131 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那天我在现场留下了一些线索</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:16:47.214 --> 00:16:51.885 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在拔刀斋
应该已经注意到了我的存在</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:16:52.511 --> 00:16:57.725 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果我送一封信给他 他一定会赴约</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:16:57.808 --> 00:17:00.185 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是说你负责引他出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:17:00.269 --> 00:17:03.022 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后你来干掉他</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:17:03.105 --> 00:17:04.398 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:17:07.401 --> 00:17:08.610 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不赖</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:17:09.278 --> 00:17:11.030 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我还是不喜欢</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:17:12.406 --> 00:17:16.452 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋不是你在新选组的宿敌吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:17:16.535 --> 00:17:19.913 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你怎么会这么轻易让给我？</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:17:21.123 --> 00:17:24.668 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我在涩海面前说他是我的宿敌</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:17:25.252 --> 00:17:27.629 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>实际上对我来说 怎样都无所谓</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:17:28.255 --> 00:17:29.423 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说过</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:35.846 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只想把这个
意外多捡来的后半生过得有趣</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:17:35.929 --> 00:17:40.809 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>与其冒着危险赚上一大笔
不如赚点能实际入手的小钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:17:41.518 --> 00:17:44.772 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>藤田五郎就是这种人啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:17:47.816 --> 00:17:51.737 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我喜欢你的话 就照你说的做</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:17:52.571 --> 00:17:55.449 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但有一件事你要记住</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:17:56.075 --> 00:18:00.162 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>组织里最强的人是本大爷</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.335 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不巧</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:18:06.919 --> 00:18:09.838 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>和井底之蛙争第一</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:18:10.506 --> 00:18:13.092 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没兴趣</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:18:18.931 --> 00:18:20.349 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:18:20.432 --> 00:18:23.227 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰让你去买点豆腐</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:18:23.811 --> 00:18:28.315 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起 弥彦
在下接下来有点事要做</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:18:28.899 --> 00:18:33.112 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可能会晚点回来 你一定要锁好门啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:18:37.407 --> 00:18:39.535 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那…豆腐…</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:18:44.498 --> 00:18:45.749 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:18:45.833 --> 00:18:48.085 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别装模做样了 快出来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:18:52.381 --> 00:18:54.591 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>轻松避开了我的锁链</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:18:54.675 --> 00:18:57.344 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不愧是拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:18:58.303 --> 00:19:00.556 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是什么人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:19:01.181 --> 00:19:06.019 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤末有人 取你性命之人</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:19:06.812 --> 00:19:10.732 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下被人盯上是常有的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:15.320 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但并不打算不明不白地轻易交出性命</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:19:15.404 --> 00:19:17.865 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>首先让在下听听你的理由</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:19:17.948 --> 00:19:20.117 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>理由…</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:19:20.784 --> 00:19:22.452 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:19:22.536 --> 00:19:25.497 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会在你的坟前好好告诉你的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:19:25.581 --> 00:19:28.834 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我看见了…你在左边 拔刀…</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:19:29.835 --> 00:19:31.420 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说你看见了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:19:32.045 --> 00:19:34.631 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看见的是在下的残影吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:19:35.215 --> 00:19:38.093 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下的动作根本就不算快</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:19:47.895 --> 00:19:49.479 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>老实投降吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:19:49.563 --> 00:19:52.191 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你打不倒在下的</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:19:55.277 --> 00:19:58.238 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快回答 你是什么人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:19:59.072 --> 00:20:01.742 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你跟斋藤有什么关系？</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:06.830 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起 我错了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:20:06.914 --> 00:20:08.832 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>饶了我吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:20:08.916 --> 00:20:11.668 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我本来也不想做的</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:20:12.252 --> 00:20:15.881 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是斋藤那家伙逼我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:20:16.673 --> 00:20:18.383 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是个杂鱼啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:20:19.176 --> 00:20:20.761 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>派一个这么弱的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:20:20.844 --> 00:20:24.640 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤那家伙到底在想什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:20:25.224 --> 00:20:28.602 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的话不能全信</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:20:28.685 --> 00:20:30.979 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你今后就金盆洗手吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:32.689 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:20:32.773 --> 00:20:35.692 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你以为我真的放弃了？蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:20:38.695 --> 00:20:43.617 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>瞬间用右手护住脖子
这个动作的确很利落</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:45.077 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但接下来怎么办？</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:48.163 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你双手都被缠住了</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:20:48.247 --> 00:20:50.832 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>根本动不了</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:21:02.261 --> 00:21:03.720 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心那家伙…</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:21:03.804 --> 00:21:07.224 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>到底有什么事要做啊？真是的</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:22:46.239 --> 00:22:49.076 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《露出獠牙的狼》</c.simplifiedchinese>

